# Brief

## Who asks and what
The head of sales of a UK online retailer wants a monthly business review:
which months sales rise or drop, and is there a seasonal pattern.

## My 3 questions
1. How does revenue change month by month?
2. Which products and countries bring in the most revenue?
3. Do customers come back and buy again?

## Definitions
- Revenue = Quantity x Price for each row, added up.
- Order = one invoice number.
- Customer = one Customer ID (rows without one are left out of customer
  questions).
- Repeat customer = a customer with 2 or more different invoices.

## The period
2009-12-01 to 2011-12-09. December 2011 has only 9 days.

## What I'm unsure about
- Cancellations (invoices starting with C).
- Missing Customer ID (about 23%).
- Some removed repeated rows may have been real purchases.